{"text": "To solve this problem, we need to use the numbers 9, 9, 11, and 13 with the operations +, -, *, / exactly once to get a result of 24.", "start": 0, "end": 133, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Heres one possible solution:", "start": 134, "end": 162, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Start by considering the numbers and operations:", "start": 164, "end": 212, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(13 - 9) × (11 - 9)", "start": 214, "end": 233, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Lets break it down step by step:", "start": 235, "end": 267, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. Calculate 13 - 9 :", "start": 269, "end": 290, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "13 - 9 = 4", "start": 291, "end": 301, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. Calculate 11 - 9 :", "start": 303, "end": 324, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "11 - 9 = 2", "start": 325, "end": 335, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Multiply the results from the previous steps:", "start": 337, "end": 385, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "4 × 2 = 8", "start": 386, "end": 395, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "It seems that the result is 8, which is not 24.", "start": 397, "end": 444, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We need to find another combination.", "start": 445, "end": 481, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try another method:", "start": 482, "end": 507, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(13 - 11) × 9 + 9", "start": 509, "end": 526, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Lets break it down step by step:", "start": 528, "end": 560, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. Calculate 13 - 11 :", "start": 562, "end": 584, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "13 - 11 = 2", "start": 585, "end": 596, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. Multiply the result by 9:", "start": 598, "end": 626, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2 × 9 = 18", "start": 627, "end": 637, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Add 9 to the result:", "start": 639, "end": 662, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "18 + 9 = 27", "start": 663, "end": 674, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This combination also doesnt work.", "start": 676, "end": 710, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Lets try another approach:", "start": 711, "end": 737, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(11 - 9) × (9 + 13)", "start": 739, "end": 758, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Lets break it down step by step:", "start": 760, "end": 792, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. Calculate 11 - 9 :", "start": 794, "end": 815, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "11 - 9 = 2", "start": 816, "end": 826, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. Calculate 9 + 13 :", "start": 828, "end": 849, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "9 + 13 = 22", "start": 850, "end": 861, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Multiply the results from the previous steps:", "start": 863, "end": 911, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2 × 22 = 44", "start": 912, "end": 923, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This also doesnt give 24.", "start": 925, "end": 950, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Lets try the following combination:", "start": 951, "end": 986, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(11 + 13) - (9 div 9)", "start": 988, "end": 1009, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Lets break it down step by step:", "start": 1011, "end": 1043, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. Calculate 11 + 13 :", "start": 1045, "end": 1067, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "11 + 13 = 24", "start": 1068, "end": 1080, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. Calculate 9 div 9 :", "start": 1082, "end": 1104, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "9 div 9 = 1", "start": 1105, "end": 1116, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Subtract the result from the previous step:", "start": 1118, "end": 1164, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "24 - 1 = 23", "start": 1165, "end": 1176, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "It doesnt work either.", "start": 1178, "end": 1200, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try one more combination:", "start": 1201, "end": 1232, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(11 + 13) - 9 + 9", "start": 1234, "end": 1251, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Lets break it down step by step:", "start": 1253, "end": 1285, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. Calculate 11 + 13 :", "start": 1287, "end": 1309, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "11 + 13 = 24", "start": 1310, "end": 1322, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. Subtract 9:", "start": 1324, "end": 1338, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "24 - 9 = 15", "start": 1339, "end": 1350, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Add 9:", "start": 1352, "end": 1361, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "15 + 9 = 24", "start": 1362, "end": 1373, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This works!", "start": 1375, "end": 1386, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Therefore, the correct expression is:", "start": 1387, "end": 1424, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(11 + 13) - 9 + 9 = 24", "start": 1426, "end": 1448, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So, the final answer is:", "start": 1450, "end": 1474, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(11 + 13) - 9 + 9", "start": 1476, "end": 1493, "label": "inform"}
